<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Confirmación de Compra - {{eventName}}</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Unbounded:wght@400;900&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@300;700&family=Crimson+Pro:ital,wght@1,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            border-radius: 0 !important;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #fff;
            background-color: #000;
            background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');
            background-repeat: repeat;
            padding: 20px 10px;
        }
        
        .email-container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            border-bottom: 8px solid #fff;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .ref-id {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            right: 10px;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #00FF00;
        }
        
        .check-icon {
            font-size: 120px;
            color: #00FF00;
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,255,0,0.8);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: block;
        }
        
        .header h1 {
            font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif;
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 72px;
            color: #fff;
            line-height: 1;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transform: skew(-5deg) scaley(1.2);
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .header p {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            font-size: 12px;
            background-color: #000;
            color: #00FF00;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border: 1px solid #00FF00;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        
        .event-section {
            position: relative;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        
        .confirmed-badge {
            position: absolute;
            top: -20px;
            right: -15px;
            background-color: #FF5F1F;
            color: #000;
            font-family: 'Unbounded', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 20px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            transform: rotate(6deg);
            border: 2px solid #000;
            z-index: 10;
            clip-path: polygon(2% 0%, 98% 2%, 100% 15%, 97% 30%, 100% 45%, 98% 60%, 100% 75%, 97% 90%, 99% 100%, 0% 98%, 3% 85%, 0% 70%, 2% 55%, 0% 40%, 4% 25%, 1% 10%);
        }
        
        .event-card {
            background-color: #fff;
            color: #000;
            padding: 32px;
            border: 6px solid #000;
        }
        
        .event-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        
        .event-id {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 10px;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }
        
        .barcode-strip {
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #fff, #fff 2px, transparent 2px, transparent 6px);
            height: 40px;
            width: 120px;
            background-color: #000;
        }
        
        .event-card h2 {
            font-family: 'Unbounded', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 64px;
            line-height: 1;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transform: skew(-5deg) scaley(1.2);
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            border-bottom: 4px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        
        .event-details {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }
        
        .event-detail {
            background-color: #000;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 16px;
        }
        
        .event-detail-label {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 9px;
            opacity: 0.6;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            display: block;
        }
        
        .event-detail-value {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .event-location {
            margin-top: 16px;
            font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .section-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            margin: 48px 0 32px 0;
        }
        
        .section-title-line {
            flex-grow: 1;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: #fff;
        }
        
        .section-title h3 {
            font-family: 'Unbounded', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 24px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-style: italic;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        
        .ticket-card {
            background-color: #fff;
            color: #000;
            border: 6px solid #000;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 32px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .ticket-info {
            flex-grow: 1;
            min-width: 250px;
        }
        
        .ticket-type-badge {
            background-color: #000;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 10px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .ticket-code {
            font-family: 'Unbounded', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 48px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            word-break: break-all;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .ticket-details {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 24px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-top: 2px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            padding-top: 16px;
        }
        
        .ticket-qr {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 8px;
            border: 4px solid #000;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        
        .ticket-qr img {
            width: 160px;
            height: 160px;
            display: block;
            filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(2);
        }
        
        .total-section {
            background-color: #FF5F1F;
            border: 6px solid #000;
            padding: 32px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 48px 0;
        }
        
        .total-badge {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            right: 0;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 8px;
            color: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            transform: rotate(90deg);
            padding: 8px;
        }
        
        .total-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: baseline;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        
        .total-label {
            font-family: 'Unbounded', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 36px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #000;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        
        .total-amount {
            font-family: 'Unbounded', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 56px;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            color: #000;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        
        .total-meta {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-top: 24px;
            opacity: 0.6;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        
        .total-meta div {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #000;
        }
        
        .instructions-section {
            background-color: #000;
            border: 6px solid #fff;
            padding: 32px;
            margin: 48px 0;
        }
        
        .instructions-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        
        .instructions-header h5 {
            font-family: 'Unbounded', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 28px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #fff;
        }
        
        .important-badge {
            background-color: #FF5F1F;
            color: #000;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            font-style: italic;
            clip-path: polygon(2% 0%, 98% 2%, 100% 15%, 97% 30%, 100% 45%, 98% 60%, 100% 75%, 97% 90%, 99% 100%, 0% 98%, 3% 85%, 0% 70%, 2% 55%, 0% 40%, 4% 25%, 1% 10%);
        }
        
        .instructions-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }
        
        .instructions-list li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 16px;
            border-left: 4px solid #FF5F1F;
            padding-left: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        
        .instruction-icon {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #FF5F1F;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        
        .instruction-text {
            font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #fff;
        }
        
        .instruction-text strong {
            color: #FF5F1F;
        }
        
        .footer {
            padding-top: 80px;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        .glitch-line {
            height: 2px;
            background: white;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 8px 0;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .glitch-line::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            right: 0;
            top: 0;
            height: 100%;
            width: 30%;
            background: #FF5F1F;
        }
        
        .footer-meta {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 9px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            opacity: 0.5;
            margin-top: 24px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        
        .footer-arrow {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 32px;
            font-size: 64px;
            animation: bounce 2s infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(10px); }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .header h1 {
                font-size: 48px;
            }
            
            .event-card h2 {
                font-size: 40px;
            }
            
            .ticket-code {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
            
            .total-label {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
            
            .total-amount {
                font-size: 40px;
            }
            
            .instructions-header h5 {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <header class="header">
            <div class="ref-id">REF_ID: {{orderId}}</div>
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <h1>¡PAGO EXITOSO!</h1>
            <p>SYSTEM_RESPONSE: 200_OK // TRANSACTION_VERIFIED</p>
        </header>
        
        <!-- Event Section -->
        <section class="event-section">
            <div class="confirmed-badge">CONFIRMED</div>
            <div class="event-card">
                <div class="event-header">
                    <div class="event-id">ID: {{eventId}}</div>
                    <div class="barcode-strip"></div>
                </div>
                <h2>{{eventName}}</h2>
                <div class="event-details">
                    <div class="event-detail">
                        <span class="event-detail-label">DATE_ENTRY</span>
                        <span class="event-detail-value">{{formatDate eventDate}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{#if eventVenueName}}
                    <div class="event-detail">
                        <span class="event-detail-label">ACCESS_POINT</span>
                        <span class="event-detail-value">{{eventVenueName}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                </div>
                {{#if eventLocation}}
                <div class="event-location">{{eventLocation}}</div>
                {{/if}}
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <!-- Tickets Section -->
        <div class="section-title">
            <div class="section-title-line"></div>
            <h3>TUS ENTRADAS ({{totalTickets}})</h3>
            <div class="section-title-line"></div>
        </div>
        
        {{#each tickets}}
        <div class="ticket-card">
            <div class="ticket-info">
                <div class="ticket-type-badge">{{type}}_ADMISSION</div>
                <div class="ticket-code">{{code}}</div>
                <div class="ticket-details">
                    <div>PRECIO: {{formatPrice price currency}}</div>
                    <div>COMPRA: {{formatDate purchaseDate}}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ticket-qr">
                <img src="https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=320x320&data={{qrToken}}" alt="QR {{code}}">
            </div>
        </div>
        {{/each}}
        
        <!-- Total Section -->
        <section class="total-section">
            <div class="total-badge">AUTHORIZED_BY_SYSTEM</div>
            <div class="total-content">
                <h4 class="total-label">TOTAL PAGADO</h4>
                <div class="total-amount">{{formatPrice totalAmount currency}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="total-meta">
                <div>Transaction Hash: 0x{{orderId}}</div>
                <div>METHOD: DIGITAL_CREDIT</div>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <!-- Instructions Section -->
        <section class="instructions-section">
            <div class="instructions-header">
                <span class="important-badge">IMPORTANT</span>
                <h5>INSTRUCCIONES</h5>
            </div>
            <ul class="instructions-list">
                <li>
                    <span class="instruction-icon">⚠</span>
                    <p class="instruction-text">
                        <strong>GUARDA ESTE EMAIL:</strong> Contiene tus entradas digitales. No lo borres bajo ninguna circunstancia.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span class="instruction-icon">🖨</span>
                    <p class="instruction-text">
                        <strong>PDFs ADJUNTOS:</strong> Cada entrada tiene su PDF individual para imprimir. Si el digital falla, usa papel.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span class="instruction-icon">🕐</span>
                    <p class="instruction-text">
                        <strong>LLEGA TEMPRANO:</strong> Te recomendamos llegar 30 minutos antes del evento. Puertas se cierran puntualmente.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span class="instruction-icon">📱</span>
                    <p class="instruction-text">
                        <strong>PRESENTA TU ENTRADA:</strong> Muestra el código QR en tu móvil o imprime los PDFs adjuntos. Brillo al máximo.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span class="instruction-icon">🚫</span>
                    <p class="instruction-text">
                        <strong>NO COMPARTAS:</strong> Cada código QR es único y personal. Si lo compartas, pierdes el acceso.
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        
        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer class="footer">
            <div class="glitch-line"></div>
            <div class="glitch-line"></div>
            <div class="footer-meta">
                <div>GEN_TIMESTAMP: {{timestamp}}</div>
                <div>BRUTALIST_EMAIL_SYSTEM_v4.2.0<br/>ALL RIGHTS RESERVED // 2026</div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-arrow">⬇</div>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
